    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Fewest input frames carried by each packet. A packet carries more than
        this whenever the send interval needs it: enough to repeat everything the
        previous packet held, so a single dropped packet does not leave a hole in
        the receiver''s buffer.'
